ng!",beaconHint:"The lighthouse flared and blasted the shadows off it! (Upgrade the beam in the Hangar)",comboLabel:"COMBO",comboNames:["","GOLD","BLUE","WHITE"],comboRanks:["Nice!","Great!","Awesome!","Unstoppable!"],comboBonus:"{name} · Damage +{p}%",combo1:"Combo {n}: Gold Flame! Damage +{p}% (keep hitting to hold it)",combo2:"Combo {n}: Blue Flame! Damage +{p}%",combo3:"Combo {n}: White Flame! Damage +{p}%",emberDrop:"A shadow dropped an ember! Fly into it for special shots",hullLabel:"Hull",setHead:"Settings",setSound:"Sound",setShake:"Screen shake",setFlash:"Slam flash",setComboSmall:"Small combo text",note65:{title:"New ways to play!",rows:[{c:"#c9a6ff",t:"Keep moving!",d:"Shadows come from the sky and the sea, and staying put too long invites an ambush. Arrows at the screen edge show where they come from"},{c:"#ffd36b",t:"Combo",d:"Keep hitting to build a combo for more damage (Gold, Blue, White flame). Getting hit, losing a light or a house hit drops it a level"},{c:"#78c4ff",t:"Embers",d:"Defeated shadows may drop an ember that floats up and right. Fly into it for 8 seconds of special shots"},{c:"#ff9a7a",t:"Hull",d:"The bar under your lights, top left. Getting hit wears it down; when it runs out the lighthouse loses a light. Elites spit bolts and Bosses slam a whole area, so dodge the warnings. Fuel refills it automatically (buy in the Shop, set in the Hangar)"},{c:"#86f0c8",t:"Helpers",d:"The lighthouse flares to knock shadows back, lit lamps zap shadows at the houses, a crosshair shows what you are lined up with, and two losses in a row make the next night easier"}],go:"Got it, let's go!",again:"See new features"},fuelUsed:"Auto-refueled: hull +{add} ({n} cans left)",fuelUsedFull:"Premium fuel: hull fully restored ({n} cans left)",hullLow:"Hull almost gone! Fuel refills it automatically (sold under Supplies in the shop; you got one free) — dodge for now",hullHint:"Getting hit wears down your hull (the bar under your lights, top left). If it runs out, th