 rescued.",lostAgain:"so give it another try.",toTown:"Back to Town",toTownLook:"See the Town",again:"Defend Again",retry:"Retry"},Bde={names:{boss:"Boss Night",rush:"Rush Night",fog:"Fog Night",wind:"Gale Night"},intro:{boss:"One more boss in the last wave · Shards ×{k}",rush:"More shadows, packed tighter · Shards ×{k}",fog:"Thick fog: you can only see around your plane · Shards ×{k}",wind:"Gales push your plane around · Shards ×{k}"}},kde={title:"Weekly Challenge",sub:"This week: {block} · Night {night} · {special}",rules:"Same setup for everyone: guns Lv 3, all four upgrade lines Lv {lv}, no supplies, parts, potions or ultimates. New every Monday",best:"Best this week {n}",bestInline:" (best this week {n})",reward:"First clear this week ◆{n}",rewardDone:"Weekly reward claimed",go:"Challenge",locked:"Hold Lighthouse Bay to unlock",label:"Weekly Challenge · Night {night} · {special}",score:"Score",newBest:"New weekly best!",weekReward:"Weekly reward",watch:"Watch an ad: double the reward (+{n})",noReward:"Weekly reward already claimed; your score still counts",lostNote:"Not this time. You can try again this week; your best run counts.",retry:"Try Again",rank:"Weekly Ranking"},Rde={signs:{repairshop:"REPAIR"},introTitle:"The Last Lamp",introBody:`Every night, shadows come in from the sea.
Guard the lighthouse and relight the town, one lamp at a time.`,introStart:"Start",continue:"Continue",depart:"Take Off",chooseBlock:"Which district will you guard tonight?",bonusDay:"Today ×2",bonusDayHint:"Shards ×2 on a win",blockLocked:"Locked",unlockAfter:"Opens once you hold {block}",unlocked:"{block} is open!",unlockedSub:"Tap the district name at the top left to visit",townNames:{harbor:"Lighthouse Bay",tide:"Tide Harbor"},goTown:{harbor:"Back to Bay",tide:"Tide Harbor"},townLocked:"Opens once all five Lighthouse Bay districts are fully lit",unlockAfterTown:"Opens once every district in {town} is fully lit",townOpen:"Tide Harbor is open!",townOpenSub:"Lighthouse Bay is fully lit. Someone across the sea keeps a lamp too: tap the town button at the top left",townArrive:"Across the sea, someone is still keeping a lamp",nightPick:"Night {n}",sweep:"Sweep",sweepPill:"Sweep ◆{s}",sweepLine:"Sweep: skip a district you have held and get the shards for your best night · {n} left today",sweepLineVip:"Sweep: skip a district you have held and get the shards for your best night · {n} left today (VIP +{k})",sweepDone:"Swept {block}, night {n}: +{s} shards, {k} left today",sweepNoLeft:"No sweeps left today. Come back tomorrow",idleBtn:"Earnings ◆{n}",idleFull:"Full",idleGot:"The shops earned for {h} h: +{n} shards (they save up to {cap} h)",mateTaken:"You were away too long. {names} gave up waiting and the shadows took them… the shop is closed. Go back to that street and rescue them",nameSep:", ",nightBest:"Best {n}",nightNew:"A new night",nightSpecial:"Night {n} · {special}",hangar:"Hangar",privacy:"Privacy",lit:"Lit",notEnough:"{n} more shards needed",trappedFirst:"Rescue {name} first",allLit:"{block} is fully lit!",tapHint:"Tap a house, a street lamp or the plane",repair:"Repair",rebuild:"Rebuild",light:"Light",now:"Now",after:"Repaired",afterLamp:"Lit",repaired:"Fixed!",freeRepair:"Free repair ({n} left today)",freeRebuild:"Free rebuild ({n} left today)"},Cde={ahe:{justRescued:"You were the one who pulled me out of the old house. In wave {wave} the shadows were right overhead. I thought I’d never get out… Thank you.",houseDamaged:"{house} got wrecked by that big brute last night. It needs fixing.",lowLamps:"When the lighthouse flames dropped to {n}, I couldn’t even look that way.",perfect:"Not a single flame went out! Everyone in town is talking about you.",lost:"The lighthouse went dark… but the houses are still standing. Rest a bit and we’ll try again.",homeDamaged:"My house got wrecked again… The soup shop will stay closed until it’s fixed.",waitingHome:"Once the old house is fixed, I’d like to open a hot soup shop here.",rebuilt:"The lights are on in my house! I’m getting ready to open. Next time you’re back, there’ll be soup.",shopOpen:"The soup shop is open! Come have a bowl and warm up after your night watch.",lampsLit:"Since the street lamps came back on, more people are out at night.",allLit:"The whole street is lit. Look, even the lighthouse seems brighter."},xiaoman:{justRescued:"You pulled me out of the ruined Lamp Station that day. Wave {wave}, and the fog was so thick I couldn’t see my own hands.",houseDamaged:"{house} got wrecked. That big brute ripped the door right off.",lowLamps:"When the lighthouse flames dropped to {n}, I was counting them for you at the end of the bridge.",perfect:"Not a single flame went out! Even the fog on the river thinned a little.",lost:"The lighthouse went dark… but the bridge is still here. We’ll light it again tomorrow night.",homeDamaged:"The Lamp Moths wrecked the Lamp Station again and the whole bridge went dark… It needs fixing, fast.",waitingHome:"I’ll make do in the shed for a few nights. Once the Lamp Station is fixed, I want the whole bridge lit up.",rebuilt:"The Lamp Station is fixed! I’m polishing the oldest lamp. When you’re back from your next night, the Eternal Lamp on the bridge will be lit.",shopOpen:"The Eternal Lamp is lit! However thick the fog, no one crossing the bridge will lose their way.",allLit:"The whole bridge is lit. From up in the sky, does it look like a ribbon of light?",tip:"Lamp Moths hunt for the Lamp Station. If you see them heading for the bridge, stop them first."},ayu:{justRescued:"You pulled me out of the ruined Lantern Shop that day. Wave {wave}, with a whole shop’s worth of lantern frames piled on top of me.",houseDamaged:"{house} got wrecked. Cloth and crates are scattered all over the street.",lowLamps:"When the lighthouse flames dropped to {n}, I squeezed my lantern so hard it crumpled.",perfect:"Not a single flame went out! Tomorrow I’ll make a few more lanterns to hang up.",lost:"The lighthouse went dark… but the lantern frames survived. New paper, and it’s a lamp again.",homeDamaged:"The Lantern Shop got wrecked again. The market will have to rest until it’s fixed.",waitingHome:"I’m making lanterns in my tent for now. Once the Lantern Shop is rebuilt, I want to open the market again.",rebuilt:"The shop is fixed! I’m making lanterns for every stall. When you’re back from your next night, the market will be open.",shopOpen:"The market is open! Lanterns hang all along the street. Come take a stroll after your watch.",allLit:"The whole market is lit. Strings and strings of lanterns, like stars hung over the street.",tip:"Darters go for the shops. When one stops and its eyes light up, it’s about to lunge: shoot it quick."},alan:{justRescued:"You pulled me out of the ruined Chime House that day. Wave {wave}, and every chime in the house was ringing. I thought they were seeing me off.",houseDamaged:"{house} got wrecked. Broken tiles rolled all the way down the stone steps.",lowLamps:"When the lighthouse flames dropped to {n}, I was counting them for you up on the hill.",perfect:"Not a single flame went out! The chimes on the hill rang all night.",lost:"The lighthouse went dark… but the chimes are still hanging. One gust and they’ll ring again.",homeDamaged:"The Chime House got wrecked again and the slope lamps went out with it. I’ll light them once it’s fixed.",waitingHome:"I’m grinding brass in a tent below the steps for now. Once the Chime House is rebuilt, I want to light up the whole slope.",rebuilt:"The house is fixed! I’m hanging lamps along the slope and chimes under the eaves. Come and see after your next night.",shopOpen:"All the slope lamps are lit! When the wind blows, every chime in the house sings.",allLit:"The whole hillside is lit. From the sea it must look like a string of stars climbing the hill.",tip:"Rollers tumble down from the hilltop and slam every house they bounce on. When one stops at the top, get there first."},asui:{justRescued:"You pulled me out of the ruined Mill that day. Wave {wave}, a windmill blade had snapped, and I thought it would never turn again.",houseDamaged:"{house} got wrecked. Straw and splinters are all over the field paths.",lowLamps:"When the lighthouse flames dropped to {n}, I was counting them for you at the edge of the wheat field.",perfect:"Not a single flame went out! The windmill turned all night and the wheat slept soundly.",lost:"The lighthouse went dark… but the wind still blows and the windmill keeps turning. We’ll try again tomorrow.",homeDamaged:"The Mill got wrecked again. The windmill stopped and the field lamps went out too. I’ll light them once it’s fixed.",waitingHome:"I’m sewing grain sacks in a tent by the field for now. Once the Mill is rebuilt and the windmill turns, I want the whole field lit.",rebuilt:"The Mill is fixed and the windmill is turning again! I’m hanging lamps on the scarecrows and planting lamp posts along the paths. Come and see after your next night.",shopOpen:"All the field lamps are lit! As the windmill turns, the whole sea of wheat glows.",allLit:"Even this farthest field is lit. From the lighthouse, the five districts make one river of light.",tip:"Fluffs burst into three Seeds when shot, and each Seed heads for the nearest house. Hit them while they’re far away: Seeds take a long time to arrive."},axi:{justRescued:"You pulled me out of the ruined Fisher’s Hut that day. Wave {wave}, the waves were already at the door and I thought I’d be swept away.",houseDamaged:"{house} got wrecked. Nets and floats are drifting all over the wharf.",lowLamps:"When the lighthouse flames dropped to {n}, I was counting them for you from the water by the pier.",perfect:"Not a single flame went out! None of the boats drifted off all night.",lost:"The lighthouse went dark… but the tide always goes out again. We’ll try again tomorrow.",homeDamaged:"The Fisher’s Hut got wrecked again, and the fishing lamps went out. I’ll light them once it’s fixed.",waitingHome:"I’m mending nets in a tent by the pier for now. Once the hut is rebuilt, I want fishing lamps all along the pier.",rebuilt:"The hut is fixed! I’m hanging lamps along the pier and on the boats. Come and see after your next night.",shopOpen:"The fishing lamps are all lit! Boat after boat, the whole harbor is glowing.",allLit:"So there are night watchers across the sea too… Look, the two lighthouses are waving at each other.",tip:"Surge Shades can’t be hit while they swim in the waves. Keep your eye on the dark crest and shoot the moment one leaps out at a house."},aling:{justRescued:"You pulled me out of the ruined Pump House that day. Wave {wave}, the salt pans were full of shadows and I didn’t dare blink.",houseDamaged:"{house} got wrecked. Salt is spilled everywhere, all white.",lowLamps:"When the lighthouse flames dropped to {n}, I was watching for you from the top of the pump.",perfect:"Not a single flame went out! The salt pans reflected the lamps like a sky full of stars.",lost:"The lighthouse went dark… I’ll keep watching the sea until you come back tomorrow.",homeDamaged:"The Pump House got wrecked again. The pump stopped and the salt lamps went out.",waitingHome:"I’m keeping watch from a tent by the salt pans for now. Once the Pump House is rebuilt and the pump turns, I want every pan lit.",rebuilt: