ns are saved to Play Games, so you keep them on a new phone",cloudOff:"Not signed in to Play Games: your progress and skins are only saved on this phone",note:{on:"Saved to the Google Play Games cloud: you keep it on a new phone or after reinstalling",off:"Saved on this phone only (not signed in to Google Play Games)",signIn:"Sign in to Google Play Games",signInSub:"No registration",signingIn:"Signing in…",signedIn:"Signed in. Your progress and skins are now saved to the cloud",failed:"Could not sign in. Try again later; your progress and skins are still saved on this phone",infoLink:"Purchases & saving",infoTitle:"Purchases & saving",info:[["No account needed","Just open the game to play and to buy."],["Payment is handled by Google Play","The game never sees your card or payment details."],["You always get what you paid for","If the game closes, crashes or loses connection while opening a box, it opens it automatically next time. Each purchase opens exactly once."],["Pending payments are safe too","If you pay later (for example cash at a convenience store), the box opens automatically the next time you open the game after the payment goes through."],["New phone or reinstall",'When you are signed in to Google Play Games (most phones sign in automatically, no registration), your progress (districts, shards, hangar, titles…) and your skins and monster costumes are saved to the cloud in your own Google account and come back on a new phone. If you are not signed in, they stay on this phone only and are lost if you uninstall or clear the app data, so tap "Sign in to Google Play Games" below.'],["What is in a Lucky Box","Skins and costumes are mostly about looks; wear all three pieces of one set for a small bonus in battle (one stat +3% per set, +4% for the hidden set). The odds are shown before you buy. Revive Cards revive you when the lamps go out (up to 2 times a battle); Everything in the shop is bought with Diamonds: Lucky Boxes 150, Revive Cards 60, VIP Pass 120 (30